<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="constraint-removal"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Constraint removal</span><span class="sb-ptag">constraint-removal</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">It is impossible to the main constraint. Design anyway.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><div class="sb-box sb-fill"><span class="sb-label">design without it</span></div><h2 class="sb-h">Now bring the constraint back. What survives?</h2><div class="sb-box" style="height:62mm"></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
