<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="five-whys"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Five whys</span><span class="sb-ptag">five-whys</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Descend from symptom to cause. Keep asking why.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Stated problem</span><div class="sb-c-rung-problem">The problem</div></div><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Why? (1)</span><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Why? (2)</span><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Why? (3)</span><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Why? (4)</span><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><div class="sb-c-rung"><span class="sb-c-rung-label">Why? (5)</span><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><div class="sb-callout"><span class="sb-glyph">?</span><span>The bottom rung is a hypothesis, not a fact. What would test it this week?</span></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
