.sb-c-recall th:nth-child(3) { width: 16mm; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="free-recall"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Free recall</span><span class="sb-ptag">free-recall</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">With the book closed, write one thing you remember about the causes of the 1929 stock market crash per row and mark how sure you are of it. Then check each row against the source in a second colour.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><div class="sb-table-wrap sb-fill"><table class="sb-table sb-c-recall"><tr><th>What I remember</th><th>How sure (○ ◐ ●)</th><th>Right?</th></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table></div><h2 class="sb-h">What I missed: next round starts here</h2><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
