<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="self-explain"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Self-explain</span><span class="sb-ptag">self-explain</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Explain why each of the first steps follows. Then complete the later steps yourself, and explain those too.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><p class="sb-c-step"><b>1</b>3x + 5 = 17</p><h2 class="sb-h">Why does this follow?</h2><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div></div><p class="sb-c-step"><b>2</b>Subtract 5 from both sides: 3x = 12</p><h2 class="sb-h">Why does this follow?</h2><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div></div><div class="sb-box" style="height:18.5mm;min-height:18.5mm"><span class="sb-label">3. Complete this step</span></div><p class="sb-c-why">Why does this follow?</p><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div></div><div class="sb-box" style="height:18.5mm;min-height:18.5mm"><span class="sb-label">4. Complete this step</span></div><p class="sb-c-why">Why does this follow?</p><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
</html>
