.sb-ifthen-blank { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; border-bottom: 0.4pt solid var(--sb-rule); padding: 0 1mm 0.6mm; font-size: 10pt; }

.sb-c-para { margin: 0 0 2.5mm; font-size: 10pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="sheet"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">API design review</span><span class="sb-ptag">sheet</span></header><div class="sb-pbody"><h2 class="sb-h">Proposed endpoints</h2><table class="sb-table"><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Verdict</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>GET /orders</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>POST /orders/{id}/cancel</td><td></td><td></td></tr></table><p class="sb-c-para">Mark it up: keep, stop, or ask.</p><ul class="sb-check"><li><span class="sb-cbox"></span><span>Naming is consistent</span></li><li><span class="sb-cbox"></span><span>Errors are documented</span></li></ul><div class="sb-callout"><span class="sb-glyph">!</span><span>Cancel is not idempotent yet.</span></div><div class="sb-box" style="height:50mm"><span class="sb-label">alternatives</span></div><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
