<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="step-away"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Step away</span><span class="sb-ptag">step-away</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Stop here. Take a real break, and make it something easy and different: a walk, chores, or sleep on it.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><p class="sb-note">Don&#39;t reread the pages before this one. Put them face down and leave the desk.</p><div class="sb-callout"><span class="sb-glyph">→</span><span>Walk round the block, or sleep on it and come back tomorrow.</span></div><div class="sb-c-away-times"><div class="sb-box" style="height:20mm"><span class="sb-label">Break started</span></div><div class="sb-box" style="height:20mm"><span class="sb-label">Back at</span></div></div><h2 class="sb-h">What I did</h2><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div><h2 class="sb-h">Anything that surfaced while I was away</h2><div class="sb-lines sb-fill"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
