<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="stimulus-die"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Stimulus die</span><span class="sb-ptag">stimulus-die</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">No cutting: roll any six-sided die, or use the last digit of the clock&#39;s seconds, and look up the matching row on the printed table. Answer whatever it lands on.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><p class="sb-note">Roll any six-sided die, or use the last digit of the clock&#39;s seconds (on 7, 8, 9 or 0, go again).</p><table class="sb-table"><tr><th>Roll</th><th>Prompt</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>who else is affected?</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>reverse it</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>remove the constraint</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>make it 10x</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>make it 0.1x</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>steal from another field</td></tr></table><h2 class="sb-h">What the roll made me think</h2><div class="sb-lines sb-fill"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
</html>
