<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="timer"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Timer dial</span><span class="sb-ptag">timer</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Divide the sitting into phases on the dial; move the marker as each phase ends.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><svg class="sb-svg sb-c-dial" viewBox="0 0 160 160" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 80.0 12.0 A 68 68 0 0 1 148.0 80.0 L 124.0 80.0 A 44 44 0 0 0 80.0 36.0 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="0.6"/><text x="119.6" y="40.4" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="6.5" fill="#333333">warm up</text><path d="M 148.0 80.0 A 68 68 0 0 1 80.0 148.0 L 80.0 124.0 A 44 44 0 0 0 124.0 80.0 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="0.6"/><text x="119.6" y="119.6" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="6.5" fill="#333333">the hard part</text><path d="M 80.0 148.0 A 68 68 0 0 1 12.0 80.0 L 36.0 80.0 A 44 44 0 0 0 80.0 124.0 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="0.6"/><text x="40.4" y="119.6" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="6.5" fill="#333333">decide</text><path d="M 12.0 80.0 A 68 68 0 0 1 80.0 12.0 L 80.0 36.0 A 44 44 0 0 0 36.0 80.0 Z" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#888888" stroke-width="0.6"/><text x="40.4" y="40.4" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" font-size="6.5" fill="#333333">send back</text><text x="80" y="77" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#111111">40 min</text><text x="80" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-size="5.5" fill="#777777">marker starts at the top</text></svg><p class="sb-note">Clip a paperclip, or place a coin, at the top. Move it to the next segment as each phase ends.</p></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
</html>
