<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="tokens"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Tokens</span><span class="sb-ptag">tokens</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Cross off one mark per session left in this arc, and write what the next two sessions should reach.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><p class="sb-note">One mark per session left in this arc. Cross one off at each return.</p><div class="sb-c-countdown"><span class="sb-c-count">6</span><span class="sb-c-count">5</span><span class="sb-c-count">4</span><span class="sb-c-count">3</span><span class="sb-c-count">2</span><span class="sb-c-count">1</span></div><h2 class="sb-h">The nearer milestone: what the next two sessions should reach</h2><div class="sb-callout"><span class="sb-glyph">→</span><span>A rough end-to-end draft of all six chapters</span></div><p class="sb-note">Early in a long arc the end can feel far. Aim at the next milestone, not the last mark.</p></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
</html>
"
