<section class="sb-page" id="W1-P1" data-component="worst-case"><i class="sb-reg sb-tl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-tr"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-bl"></i><i class="sb-reg sb-br"></i><header class="sb-ph"><span class="sb-pid">W1-P1</span><span class="sb-ptitle">Worst case</span><span class="sb-ptag">worst-case</span></header><p class="sb-prompt">Name it plainly. Then write what would actually happen, and what you would do.</p><div class="sb-pbody"><p class="sb-note">This is to make a dread thinkable, not to make a real risk acceptable. If writing it makes it worse, stop.</p><div class="sb-callout"><span class="sb-glyph">!</span><span>The outcome I dread: Failing the professional exam in November and having to tell my manager and the whole team I need another year to pass</span></div><h2 class="sb-h">How heavy does it feel right now? (circle 0–10)</h2><div class="sb-c-weight"><span>0</span><span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>10</span></div><h2 class="sb-h">If it happened, concretely</h2><div class="sb-cols sb-fill"><div class="sb-col"><div class="sb-box sb-fill"><span class="sb-label">The next day</span></div></div><div class="sb-col"><div class="sb-box sb-fill"><span class="sb-label">The next week</span></div></div><div class="sb-col"><div class="sb-box sb-fill"><span class="sb-label">The next month</span></div></div></div><h2 class="sb-h">What I would do, and who would help</h2><div class="sb-lines"><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div><div class="sb-rule"></div></div><h2 class="sb-h">How heavy does it feel now? (circle 0–10)</h2><div class="sb-c-weight"><span>0</span><span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>10</span></div></div><footer class="sb-pfoot"><div class="sb-legend"><span><span class="sb-letter">Q</span> ask</span><span><span class="sb-letter">R</span> stop</span><span><span class="sb-letter">G</span> keep</span><span>X crux = highlighter</span><span><span class="sb-letter">O</span> maybe</span><span><span class="sb-letter">P</span> sense</span><span><span class="sb-letter">D</span> draft</span><span>B reason = black</span><span class="sb-legend-id">W1-P1</span></div></footer></section>
</body>
